      "value": "I would also like to see this feature implemented.\n\nIdeally, it could be structured similarly to how the \"fist\" gesture uses \"Gesture Right/Left Weight\" to detect trigger pulls—perhaps by introducing something like \"Trigger Right/Left Weight.\"\n\nI believe this would expand the range of possible interactions, such as pulling a trigger on a weapon, pressing a button on a camera-style gadget, or opening the pull-tab on a can—essentially enabling a \"grip-plus-press\" type of action.",
